stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Active: Begin Transaction
    Active --> Partially_Committed: Final Operation Executed
    Active --> Failed: Error / Exception / Abort Signal
    Partially_Committed --> Committed: WAL Flushed to Non-Volatile Disk
    Partially_Committed --> Failed: System Crash / Disk Write Failure
    Failed --> Aborted: Undo Phase Completed (Rollback)
    Committed --> [*]: Transaction Terminated (Success)
    Aborted --> [*]: Transaction Restarted or Terminated (Failure)
